<title>UK: South Africa sets 500 million mark seven-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>South Africa sets 500 million mark seven-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOUTH AFRICA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    01.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+140 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  S.AFRICA  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.55	SELL CONC  1.70	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT BUND DUE SEPTEMBER 2003</p>
<p>(Corrects Moody, S&amp;P ratings, and selling concession price)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
